id: oozaru-monkey-mastery
name: Monkey Mastery
order: 4
slot: mastery
mastery: 2
# Its [Permanent] effects: they hold outside the Transformation too.
permanent: 1
description: >
  You have gained the ability to contain your inner beast, allowing you true control over your beast form.
text: >
  Monkey Mastery (2): You have gained the ability to contain your inner beast, allowing you true control over your beast form.
  (1)-[Permanent]: Oozaru loses the Innate State (Feral/Raging) Aspect, and gains an Attribute Modifier Bonus (AG) of +1(T).
  (2)-[Passive]: For calculating the bonus/penalty to your Defense Value from your Size Category, and for the effects of Punching Up, you are considered to be of the Large Size Category.
  (3)-[Passive]: Reduce your Muscle Penalty by 1(bT).
  (4)-[Triggered/Transform, Triggered/Start of Turn]: Enter the Raging and/or Feral State(s) until the end of your turn.

